==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Rush down the Capy with [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] or other anti-reds and destroy the base with rushers before the zombie enemies turn into a problem.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
Rush down the base before any of the tougher enemies spawn.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
This stage is easily rushable using Awakened Bahamut with some starting money combos.

